SUMMARY:LET'S ROCK CANCER! 2026
LOCATION:Crystal Ballroom\, 55 Davis Square\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:LET'S ROCK CANCER! 2026 Dedicated to Linda Pardee Hosted by the
  one and only Henry Santoro Featuring Live Music by Jeffery Robbins of Orb
 it - with celebration of Linda Pardee (bass & vox for Orbit\, Chelsea Curv
 e) Muck & the Mires The Ray Liriano Experience...GO! and special guests Pr
 oceeds from this all ages event benefit the Cancer Care Access Program at 
 Dana-Farber\, which aims to reduce disparities in cancer outcomes among lo
 cal communities. Established in 2012\, the Program broadens access to hist
 orically marginalized patient populations and joins our community partners
  in the pursuit of equitable care across the spectrum of cancer-related di
 seases.\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.com/lets-rock-cancer-2026-somerville-mas
 sachusetts-12-11-2026/event/01006544367B983E\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https:/
 /pushpin.city/boston/
